{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act33side_level_act33side_02_end",
  "groupId": "act33side",
  "stageId": "act33side_02",
  "title": "命途何在",
  "storyCode": "BB-2",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act33side/level_act33side_02_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "b3e78ce0dd1d7eb8d10a98ea8dd61e385986d5d14507c35410a5651356a1d556",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_laccolith"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們站在這艘軍艦的轍印旁竟顯得如此渺小。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊，令人驚嘆的軍事器械。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "食腐者的血肉防線付出極大代價才阻截了戰艦的行進，女妖足以撕碎意識的尖嘯也僅僅是逼迫他們捨棄艦橋，撤往下層的指揮中心……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果不是天災在前，加之這塊峽谷地帶的險要地勢——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們的時間真的不多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "卡茲戴爾必須擁有同樣的，甚至超越他們想像的武器。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們迄今為止的嘗試都失敗了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "百多年前，誰又相信我們能夠將卡茲戴爾真的建成移動城市呢？循規蹈矩無法讓卡茲戴爾追上那些國家的步伐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "變形者剛傳回了訊息，地平線上與我們遙遙相望的軍艦都已經開始減速了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們放棄了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不。選帝侯發出的指令是繼續追擊，但是艦隊的指揮下達了減速的指令。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們在害怕天災和惡劣的地形，我們眼前這艘軍艦就是前車之鑒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那按照他們的前進速度，傍晚就是決戰的時候了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……足夠了，我們已經拖延了充足的時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "特蕾西婭回望荒野上兩股逐漸糾纏的風暴，試圖找尋那座龐大城市的蹤跡。\n一無所獲。卡茲戴爾如今已經到了哪裡？它是否仍然在風暴中遷徙？躲藏在庇護所中的居民是否依舊安好？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那兩股風暴開始聚攏了，我們的後路已經被徹底堵上了。決戰不可避免，無論如何……特雷西斯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你竟然會在戰場上走神。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……那是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那是……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "風暴在發怒，年幼者正張揚著挑釁年長者。\n新生的風暴裹挾著雷鳴撞向了奄奄一息的風暴。\n紊亂的空氣流在兩股風暴之間交錯，融合……\n狂暴孕育平靜。一條狹長的通路誕生於風暴交匯之處。\n電光閃耀，雷鳴迴盪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一條路，在風暴之中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "風暴……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "特蕾西婭，走吧，道路已被風暴鑄下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "活下來的人還有另一條路可以選。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們一起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他們的命令在下一刻便由變形者集群傳到每一位在場薩卡茲的耳中。\n戰士們看到了兩位領袖並肩走入風暴。無人遲疑，所有人動了起來。\n健全者攙扶虛弱者，勇敢者鼓勵畏怯者。漫漫長隊邁入了風暴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……特雷西斯，你看到了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "風暴的呼嘯中，那道源自幼時夢中風雪的聲音彷彿傳入了他們的耳中。\n他們看到了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……預言。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "裹在披風下的瘦弱身影聽到了身後的聲音，轉身回望，看到了迎風而行的隊伍。\n特雷西斯看到了一個孩子。薄暮般的煙霧擁著她的肩頭，在風暴中升騰，流淌，向著高空狂嘯。\n特雷西斯摘下手甲，赤手沒入煙中。\n煙霧散去，他被血絲染紅的手握住了孩子的石刃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（含糊不清的發音）你……啊……抓！抓到！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你為什麼在這？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（含糊不清的發音）家。你……家！家！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（含糊不清的發音）你！闖進！家！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "孩子用力從特雷西斯手中抽出石刃，隨後又指向他，向他身後漫長的隊伍宣戰。\n生於荒野，無懼荒野，孩子的刀下，人與野獸無異。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你想殺我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（含糊不清的發音）煞，撒……殺，你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有人教過她怎麼說話。她只是模仿著過路人的聲音而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……特雷西斯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "特雷西斯俯瞰著瘦削的生命，他沉默著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "刀，該這麼拿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（含糊不清的發音）你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "孩子看著特雷西斯伸出的手，猶豫片刻後便將鈍刃放在了他的手上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（含糊不清的發音）……我。你！帶，我……帶上，我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "特雷西斯看到了特蕾西婭的眼神。\n預言。\n“弑君之刀劍，誅王之槍矛。”\n可他們從未在乎過預言。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "跟我們走。薩卡茲的家不在荒野。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "49_g3_kazdelstreet_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“你有名字嗎？”\n“名字？「我」。”\n“那從現在起，你有新的名字了。”\n“阿斯卡綸。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "十天後\n卡茲戴爾地區，卡茲戴爾移動城市"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "激動的薩卡茲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_934_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "醫生，快看！熔爐重燃了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "激動的薩卡茲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_934_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "動了？是城市終於開始動了？嘶……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴別塔醫生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_499_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小心點！我才剛剛給你包紮好了傷口……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "激動的薩卡茲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_934_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "醫生，我得趕去熔爐那裡。熔爐重燃，卡茲戴爾還在航行……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "激動的薩卡茲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_934_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那些萊塔尼亞人沒能殺死我們！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴別塔醫生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_499_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "激動的薩卡茲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_934_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，我，我不是說你，醫生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "激動的薩卡茲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_934_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "和我一起出去看看吧，你應該和那些活下來的戰士享受同樣的榮譽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴別塔醫生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_499_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我……不是薩卡茲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "激動的薩卡茲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_934_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但現在不一樣了，你們也是英雄，醫生"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "激動的薩卡茲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_934_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "去參觀兩位殿下指揮歌利亞們支撐著的傾斜的熔爐！去看看鐵錘修復破損核心時漫天的火星！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "激動的薩卡茲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_934_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還能去聽聽女妖的輓歌，死去英雄的屍體還會被放進熔爐裡當作柴火！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "激動的薩卡茲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_934_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "過去這可是只有薩卡茲才配參加的慶典。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴別塔醫生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_499_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我很想去，但今晚還有很多傷患等著處理呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "激動的薩卡茲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_934_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……哎，好吧好吧！這樣，我去偷偷帶兩瓶酒回來，還有新鮮的水果，我們在這裡……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴別塔醫生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_499_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你哪能喝酒！而且哪有在醫療帳篷裡喝酒的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "激動的薩卡茲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_934_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小傷而已，怎麼不能？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴別塔醫生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_499_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那也不行，現在你的礦石病情況比外傷嚴重多了！而且你酒量太差了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "激動的薩卡茲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_934_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？你哪次看見過我喝酒……哦，我扛著那幾個礦石病炸彈來找你的時候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "激動的薩卡茲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_934_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這麼多年了，我就那一次喝過酒。平時喝不起，你也不是不知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴別塔醫生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_499_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉……我攔不住你，你自己去慶典不就好了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "激動的薩卡茲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_934_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒了你少點滋味。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴別塔醫生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_499_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……我……但我畢竟是萊塔尼亞人……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "激動的薩卡茲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_934_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼，難道你是支持那些靠戰爭撈錢的貴族老爺的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴別塔醫生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_499_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我就是看不起他們，才從家裡逃了出來的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "激動的薩卡茲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_934_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就對了。嗯？等等，從家裡逃出來，你難道是貴族——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴別塔醫生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_499_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不算！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "激動的薩卡茲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_934_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可第一次見面我就在想，你的設備明顯不是巴別塔掏的錢——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "激動的薩卡茲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_934_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——算了，我不亂猜了。對你沒好處。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴別塔醫生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_499_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，你自己去就好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴別塔醫生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_499_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不覺得前線的士兵能和一個萊塔尼亞人和平相處……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "激動的薩卡茲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_934_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小時候看我父親被萊塔尼亞人吊在下水道口羞辱的時候，我也沒想過能和一個卡普里尼醫生和平相處。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "激動的薩卡茲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_934_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那時候，唯一會給我們好臉色的，不是感染者，就是貧民。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴別塔醫生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_499_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "激動的薩卡茲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_934_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好。不矯情了，我去去就回。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴別塔醫生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_499_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真是，怎麼這段時間這群薩卡茲一個個都變得這麼油腔滑調……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴別塔醫生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_499_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……特蕾西婭小姐，我這也能算是更進了一步嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴別塔醫生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_499_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "總之，呼，卡茲戴爾動起來了，以後總會好起來的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴別塔醫生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_499_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？你回來就給我躺下——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴別塔醫生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_499_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，抱歉……認錯人了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陰鬱的薩卡茲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_933_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴別塔醫生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_499_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等，你的傷很嚴重……法術灼燒的位置一直沒人幫你處理？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陰鬱的薩卡茲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_933_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "萊塔尼亞人幹的。我的兒子死了，他們當著我的面把他活活燒死。就留我一個活口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴別塔醫生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_499_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……讓我看看你的傷口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陰鬱的薩卡茲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_933_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "活活燒死。他在喊，在慘叫。他被法術懸掛在空中，燒給所有人看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陰鬱的薩卡茲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_933_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的兄弟也死了，隊長也死了。萊塔尼亞人身居高處，制高點，他們高舉法杖的樣子就像……"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "幾乎精神錯亂的薩卡茲盯著醫生放在角落的萊塔尼亞法杖。\n她已經放棄的家鄉，仍舊以標識的形式懸掛在法杖上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陰鬱的薩卡茲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_933_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就像，真正的……"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "醫生沒有察覺到敵意。\n她掀開薩卡茲覆蓋傷口的衣服，卻感受到了一陣寒意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴別塔醫生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_499_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你帶著武器……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陰鬱的薩卡茲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_933_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴別塔醫生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_499_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "外面的守衛為什麼沒有檢查你……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陰鬱的薩卡茲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_933_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "魂靈熔爐的火光照亮了卡茲戴爾城市之上的整片夜空，恍如白晝。\n薪柴燃燒的劈啪聲如同低沉的嘶吼，祭奠著死去的生命。\n那一晚，薩卡茲們都不約而同地抬起了頭，他們沒有看到——\n城市的一角，一處醫療陣地的燈光靜悄悄地黯淡了下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "49_g7_councilchamber"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陰鬱的薩卡茲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_933_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "魔王殿下？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陰鬱的薩卡茲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_933_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為什麼帶我來這裡……對了，我有好消息要彙報……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼消息？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陰鬱的薩卡茲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_933_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "贏了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陰鬱的薩卡茲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_933_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "魔王殿下，我們戰勝了萊塔尼亞人，我和我的兒子，還有藍血小隊的所有人，我們贏了，贏了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陰鬱的薩卡茲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_933_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……魔王殿下，您不高興嗎？莫非是我們耽擱了戰機……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陰鬱的薩卡茲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_933_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "布萊克！我的兒子，快把作戰計劃拿給我看！兒子！兒子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陰鬱的薩卡茲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_933_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉殿下，我的兒子不知道哪裡去了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……你殺死了一個醫生。一個為卡茲戴爾服務了數年的礦石病醫生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陰鬱的薩卡茲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_933_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "卡茲戴爾？醫生？不，殿下，您一定是誤會了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陰鬱的薩卡茲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_933_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只會攻擊那些萊塔尼亞人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "特蕾西婭。你感知過他的情緒了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "痛苦，混亂，癲狂。他避開了那些慘痛的回憶，逼瘋了自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他甚至都不知道自己犯下了什麼罪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是其他人知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "衛兵找到他的時候，他正在和另一個薩卡茲鬥毆，酒桶被打碎，劣質酒精被點燃，蔓延到整個醫療陣地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所有人都等著魔王的回應，但這件事不能由你來做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "交給我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陰鬱的薩卡茲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_933_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "殿下，將軍，我戰勝了萊塔尼亞人，為此獻出了一切！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陰鬱的薩卡茲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_933_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為什麼，難道我做錯了？殿下！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "把他帶下去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……他叫洛根。名字是他的母親取的，他的母親是巴別塔最初一批工程師中的一員。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他幾乎不會使用法術，守衛們卻是遭到法術催眠。有其他人在背後推波助瀾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "軍事委員會不會為了一個外人去調查又一次闖過苦難的薩卡茲們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而我希望，巴別塔也不會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們別無他法。戰爭剛剛結束。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想，這段時間，巴別塔不該再參與任何軍政事務。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……你知道巴別塔志不在此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但很多人不這麼想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我會為巴別塔成員劃定可以活動的範圍。醫療、教育和科技建設，巴別塔將服務於此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "軍事委員會對他們的保護仍然生效。但無疑盡量避免衝突才是上策。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "被積壓的仇恨總有一天會爆發。到那時，即使是我們……即便是我也無能為力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "卡茲戴爾需要盡快迎來一次變革，我們要盡快……克服源石問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但這依舊解決不了所有問題，特蕾西婭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我一直知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "49_g6_babeloffice"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿斯卡綸，你在這。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在這座城市裡看到了什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "死……人哭……人死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哭？哭……哭泣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "特雷西斯伸出手，一柄小巧的石刃躺在他的掌心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "刀！我的……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拿好它，作為戰士，應當珍惜自己的武器。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我會教你如何把它打磨得無比鋒利。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然後，你要靠自己為它找到正確的方向。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她還沒到理解這些事的時候，你太著急了，特雷西斯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她遲早要明白的，特蕾西婭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至少現在，我們應該為這個受驚的孩子留一點鎮定下來的時間——你喜歡這座城市嗎，阿斯卡綸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "比起那個身穿鎧甲的將軍，阿斯卡綸並不喜歡這個蹲在自己面前的薩卡茲女性。\n因為她彷彿能讀懂自己的一切心思，在她的面前，自己沒有任何秘密——這是荒野上生存的大忌。\n但她卻無法對這位溫柔的薩卡茲生出敵意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……我……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不用害怕我，你能看到我對你沒有敵意，對嗎？你可以摸摸我的角，我們是一樣的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……這裡，溫暖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我，溫暖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，溫暖。仇恨與殺戮並不是解決問題的唯一辦法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……（含糊不清的發音）辦法？問題？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "特蕾西婭沒有繼續說下去，即使有魔王的幫助，生於荒野的阿斯卡綸也難以理解所有詞語。\n她慢慢捧起了阿斯卡綸的手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……就像你手心的傷口，武器不能讓傷口恢復，只有藥物和時間才能讓它慢慢恢復。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呀啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒事了，我已經為你清理了傷口，接下來你可要小心照顧它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "耐心些，等到未來某天，當你醒過來，就會發現傷口不再痛了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……嗯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_snowconutryinside"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "卡茲戴爾地區，巴別塔教室"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……沒人。在。這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再等等，現在還不是上課的時候，他們會來的——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……是你啊，特雷西斯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "軍事委員會遞上來一份報告，是關於這次的傷亡情況。其中有很多孩子，大部分也都是學生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那些活下來的孩子……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們的父母不願意再將他們交到巴別塔的那些外族人老師手裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "況且，我記得，巴別塔的不少老師因為害怕已經離開了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "特蕾西婭，你最近太過操勞這些瑣事。你需要休息。我們還需要——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想再等等看，特雷西斯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他站在原地，並沒有離開，而教室裡安靜得可怕。\n特蕾西婭閉上了眼，她回想起了這間教室來來去去的學生們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "學生們來了又去，以前她總有辦法吸引孩子們回到這間教室。\n可這一次，沒有孩子再來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "勇敢的小孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "特雷西斯殿下！殿下！我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一柄石刃的刀柄撞上了孩子的胸口。雖然孩子無法撼動阿斯卡綸的手，但他努力挺起胸膛看著眼前這個瘦高的女孩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "勇敢的小孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我看到特雷西斯殿下往這邊走，我只是想追上——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "勇敢的小孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸，特蕾西婭殿下，您也在！這間教室……是您在上課嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放下刀，阿斯卡綸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "勇敢的小孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……殿下！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你想見我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "勇敢的小孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是。我來幫那些失去父母的孩子求一個答案。我知道軍事委員會能照顧好他們，就像照顧我一樣……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "勇敢的小孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是……這會帶來任何的變化嗎？如果戰爭又來了呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "勇敢的小孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想改變，可我不知道可以改變什麼，也不知道要去改變什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "兩位殿下看著這位毫無怯意的孩子，他們的心中刹那間都有了各自的答案。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你叫什麼名字？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "勇敢的小孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "曼弗雷德。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "49_g3_kazdelstreet_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷糊的小孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1303_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "爸爸，我們已經在家門口站了很久了，為什麼不進去呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好運",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1305_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好運",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1305_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "媽媽受了很重很重的傷，她需要一個人在裡面休息，我們不該打擾她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷糊的小孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1303_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是我想媽媽了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好運",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1305_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "爸爸也想，但是現在不行……等我辦完事回來，我們再一起回家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷糊的小孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1303_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "爸爸要去哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好運",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1305_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我要再出一趟城，讓那些欺負媽媽的人付出代價。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好運",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1305_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你暫時留在這，等爸爸回來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷糊的小孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1303_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "爸爸可以不走嗎？爸爸留在這，我們一起想辦法讓媽媽好起來……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好運",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1305_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你喜歡媽媽的名字嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷糊的小孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1303_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，喜歡，媽媽的名字很好聽……奧達。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好運",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1305_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "以後它就是你的名字了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷糊的小孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1303_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好運",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1305_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "奧達，等爸爸回來，就教你用媽媽的武器打壞人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1303_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，我要打那些欺負媽媽的壞人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1303_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是，打跑了壞人，媽媽的傷就會好起來嗎……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好運",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1305_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "奧達……你還不明白，你以後會明白的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好運",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1305_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……你等我回來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "好運轉身離開了家門口，看向了那堵已被結晶叢林爬滿的城牆。\n如今這座城內足以令他牽掛的只有奧達。\n那個奧達……還有這個奧達。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
